---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Walk-forward on real S&P 500 returns (python): fit on 2 Dec 2016 - 2 Dec 2021 (1,259 days),
// then only filter, with parameters frozen, through 3 Dec 2021 - 25 Nov 2026 (1,250 days).
// test span: buy&hold 1.569x, max drawdown -25.4%; filtered rule 1.554x, -12.1%, in cash 30.6% of days.
const W = 900, H = 350;
---
<figure class="p5w">
  <div class="p5w-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="A timeline split into a fitting period from December 2016 to December 2021 and a test period from December 2021 to November 2026. Under the test period, buy and hold gives 1.57 with a worst fall of 25.4 percent, and the filtered rule gives 1.55 with a worst fall of 12.1 percent, in cash on 30.6 percent of days.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Fit on the past, judge on what comes after</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Khớp trên quá khứ, chấm trên phần xảy ra sau</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="40" y="56" width="400" height="56" rx="6" class="fitbox" />
    <DiagramIcon name="model" x="68" y="84" size="24" />
    <text x="92" y="80" class="t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Fit: 2 Dec 2016 to 2 Dec 2021</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Khớp: 2/12/2016 tới 2/12/2021</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="92" y="98" class="note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1,259 trading days, parameters learned here</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1.259 phiên, tham số học ở đây</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="440" y="56" width="420" height="56" rx="6" class="testbox" />
    <DiagramIcon name="lock" x="468" y="84" size="24" />
    <text x="492" y="80" class="t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Test: 3 Dec 2021 to 25 Nov 2026</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Kiểm: 3/12/2021 tới 25/11/2026</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="492" y="98" class="note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1,250 days, parameters frozen, only filtering</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1.250 phiên, tham số đóng băng, chỉ lọc</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x="40" y="160" class="t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Test period results</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Kết quả giai đoạn kiểm</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="40" y="176" width={1.569 * 260} height="26" rx="4" class="bar mid" />
    <text x={40 + 1.569 * 260 + 10} y="194" class="val">1.57×</text>
    <text x={40 + 1.569 * 260 + 64} y="194" class="note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>buy and hold, worst fall −25.4%</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>cứ giữ, sụt tối đa −25,4%</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="40" y="218" width={1.554 * 260} height="26" rx="4" class="bar ok" />
    <text x={40 + 1.554 * 260 + 10} y="236" class="val">1.55×</text>
    <text x={40 + 1.554 * 260 + 64} y="236" class="note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>filtered rule, worst fall −12.1%</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>luật filtered, sụt tối đa −12,1%</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="40" y="284" class="note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>The rule sat in cash on 30.6% of test days. It ended level with buy-and-hold</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Luật đứng ngoài tiền mặt 30,6% số phiên kiểm. Kết thúc ngang mua giữ</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="40" y="304" class="note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>and roughly halved the worst fall, which is what the model could honestly offer.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>mà sụt tối đa giảm còn khoảng một nửa, đó là điều mô hình hứa được một cách trung thực.</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="40" y="332" class="note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>One path, one index, one split: nothing here shows it will repeat.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Một đường đi, một chỉ số, một cách chia: không gì ở đây cho thấy nó sẽ lặp lại.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Walk-forward on real S&amp;P 500 returns. The smaller edge than the in-sample picture is the more believable one.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Walk-forward trên lợi suất S&amp;P 500 thật. Lợi thế nhỏ hơn bức tranh in-sample mới là cái đáng tin hơn.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .p5w { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .p5w-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .p5w svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .p5w text { fill: var(--text-body); font-size: 13px; }
  .p5w .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p5w .t { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p5w .note { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .p5w .val { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p5w .fitbox { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .p5w .testbox { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .p5w .bar { stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .p5w .bar.mid { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); }
  .p5w .bar.ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); }
  .p5w figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
